      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Neutron side: each team IP is a RESERVED port (no VM) whose address is added to the VM port's allowed-address-pairs.\nRouting by hostname inside the team: web.team1... -> web,  api.team1... -> api.  Databases are never exposed.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1484672331,
      "strokeColor": "#5c3c00",
